{"v":1,"path":"/Components/IWaypointMissionManager/IWPMZManager.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>IWPMZManager</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">IWPMZManager</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><a href=\"IWaypointMissionManager.html\">IWaypointMissionManager</a><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">IWPMZManager</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.6.0</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title\">IWPMZManager</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead\">This class is a waypoint mission editing class, which is used for loading waypoint mission files, editing waypint fields and generating waypoint mission files.</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces\" aria-label=\"Copy package name\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"Description\" style=\"display: none;\">Description:</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">This class is a waypoint mission editing class, which is used for loading waypoint mission files, editing waypint fields and generating waypoint mission files. For the meaning of the waypoint field, please refer to the code comment and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://developer.dji.com/doc/cloud-api-tutorial/cn/api-reference/dji-wpml/overview.html\">DJI WPML</a>. For the interface call process, please refer to: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://developer.dji.com/doc/mobile-sdk-tutorial/en/tutorials/waypoint.html\">Wayline Sample</a>. <br><br><code><i>Supported since MSDK 5.6.0</i></code></font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>Members</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">6</span> members</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"Filter by name, parameter or description\" aria-label=\"Filter members\"><button class=\"ifm-search-clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Clear search\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"ifm-filter-group\"><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">All</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"method\">Method</button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-groups\" id=\"ifm-groups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Method</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">6</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_getkmzinfo_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getkmzinfo load the kmz file and get the waypoint mission information in the kmz file.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getKMZInfo</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Load the KMZ file and get the waypoint mission information in the KMZ file.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfiletemplate_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"generatekmzfile generate waypoint mission kmz files by setting waypoint mission information, and the generated kmz files will be stored in kmzpath path.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">generateKMZFile</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Generate waypoint mission KMZ files by setting waypoint mission information, and the generated KMZ files will be stored in kmzPath path.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfilewayline_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"generatekmzfile generate waypoint mission kmz files by setting waypoint mission  information, and the generated kmz files will be stored in kmzpath path.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">generateKMZFile</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Generate waypoint mission KMZ files by setting waypoint mission  information, and the generated KMZ files will be stored in kmzPath path.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_checkvalidation_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"checkvalidation check some fields in the kmz file.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">checkValidation</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Check some fields in the KMZ file.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmz_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"transkmltokmz convert kml files to kmz files.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">transKMLtoKMZ</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Convert KML files to KMZ files.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmzheightmode_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"transkmltokmz convert kml files to kmz files.\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">transKMLtoKMZ</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">Convert KML files to KMZ files.</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">No matching members. Try a shorter keyword.</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_getkmzinfo\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_getkmzinfo_inline\">getKMZInfo</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_getkmzinfo_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getKMZInfo</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">KMZInfo</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getKMZInfo</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzPath</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Load the KMZ file and get the waypoint mission information in the KMZ file.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmzPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>KMZ file storage path.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">KMZInfo</font></code></td><td>Returns waypoint mission information in a KMZ file.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfiletemplate\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfiletemplate_inline\">generateKMZFile</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfiletemplate_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>generateKMZFile</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">generateKMZFile</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzPath</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMission</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">waylineMission</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMissionConfig</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">config</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">Template</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">waylineTemplate</span>  <span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Generate waypoint mission KMZ files by setting waypoint mission information, and the generated KMZ files will be stored in kmzPath path. The KMZ file generated by this interface contains a Template file, which is compatible with DJI Pilot.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmzPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>KMZ file storage path.</td></tr><tr><td><code>waylineMission</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMission</span> </code></span></td><td>Waypoint mission file information.</td></tr><tr><td><code>config</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMissionConfig</span> </code></span></td><td>Global information about waypoint mission.</td></tr><tr><td><code>waylineTemplate</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Template</span> </code></span></td><td>Waypoint mission information template class.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfilewayline\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfilewayline_inline\">generateKMZFile</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfilewayline_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>generateKMZFile</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">generateKMZFile</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzPath</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMission</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">waylineMission</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMissionConfig</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">config</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">Wayline</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">wayline</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Generate waypoint mission KMZ files by setting waypoint mission  information, and the generated KMZ files will be stored in kmzPath path. The KMZ file generated by this interface does not contain a Template file and cannot be used compatible with DJI Pilot.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmzPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>KMZ file storage path.</td></tr><tr><td><code>waylineMission</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMission</span> </code></span></td><td>Waypoint mission file information.</td></tr><tr><td><code>config</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineMissionConfig</span> </code></span></td><td>Global information about waypoint mission.</td></tr><tr><td><code>wayline</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Wayline</span> </code></span></td><td>Waypoint mission information.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_checkvalidation\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_checkvalidation_inline\">checkValidation</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_checkvalidation_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>checkValidation</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">WaylineCheckErrorMsg</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">checkValidation</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzPath</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Check some fields in the KMZ file.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmzPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>KMZ file storage path.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">WaylineCheckErrorMsg</font></code></td><td>Returns error messages in the KMZ file.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmz\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmz_inline\">transKMLtoKMZ</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmz_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>transKMLtoKMZ</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">transKMLtoKMZ</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmlImportPath</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzOutPath</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Convert KML files to KMZ files. The historical KML files generated by the DJI App can be converted into KMZ files.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmlImportPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>The KML file path that needs to be converted.</td></tr><tr><td><code>kmzOutPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>KMZ file path stored after conversion.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">boolean</font></code></td><td>true indicates that the conversion was successful.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmzheightmode\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmzheightmode_inline\">transKMLtoKMZ</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmzheightmode_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>transKMLtoKMZ</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">transKMLtoKMZ</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmlImportPath</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">kmzOutPath</span> , <span class=\"jv-type\">HeightMode</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">transParams</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">com.dji.wpmzsdk.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Convert KML files to KMZ files. When converting non-DJI-generated KML files to KMZ files, height mode needs to be provided. The supported height modes are WGS84, EGM96, and RELATIVE. The RELATIVE mode is only used for DJI Pilot display and developers can ignore it.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>kmlImportPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>The KML file path that needs to be converted.</td></tr><tr><td><code>kmzOutPath</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">String</span> </code></span></td><td>KMZ file path stored after conversion.</td></tr><tr><td><code>transParams</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">HeightMode</span> </code></span></td><td>Height mode.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\">boolean</font></code></td><td>true indicates that the conversion was successful.</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n\n        </font></font></font></font></font></font></font></div><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\"><font color=\"#666\">\n      </font></font></font>","tocHtml":"\n        <div class=\"site-toc-inner\">\n          <div class=\"site-toc-title\">On this page</div>\n          <ul data-static-toc=\"true\" class=\"site-toc-list\"><li><a href=\"#ifm-overview\" data-target=\"ifm-overview\">Overview</a></li><li><a href=\"#Class-Members\" data-target=\"ifm-members-nav\">Member Index</a></li><li class=\"toc-group\"><span class=\"toc-group-title\">Methods</span></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iwpmzmanager_getkmzinfo\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_getkmzinfo\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>getKMZInfo</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfiletemplate\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfiletemplate\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>generateKMZFile</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfilewayline\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_generatekmzfilewayline\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>generateKMZFile</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iwpmzmanager_checkvalidation\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_checkvalidation\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>checkValidation</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmz\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmz\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>transKMLtoKMZ</a></li><li class=\"ifm-toc-method\"><a href=\"#iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmzheightmode\" data-target=\"iwpmzmanager_transkmltokmzheightmode\"><span class=\"ifm-toc-kind ifm-toc-kind-method\">M</span>transKMLtoKMZ</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      ","buildId":"1795062379137"}